    },
    "source": {
      "value": "aoa6"
    },
    "description": {
      "value": "One or more of your parents (either biological or adoptive) were heroes of the Age of Ashes Adventure Path. Others tend to treat you with a bit more respect, or perhaps fear your connections to people of great power.\n\nChoose two ability boosts. One must be in Dexterity or Charisma, and the other is a free ability boost.\n\nYou're trained in the Intimidation skill and the Genealogy Lore skill. You gain the Group Coercion skill feat."
    },
